{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Information.JetHorizonScaffold","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Information.JetHorizonScaffold","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Information.QouPNeqNp","lean:module:QOU.Information.JetHorizonTransfer","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic"],"declarations":13,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Information.jetHorizonTransfer_of_dictionary","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Information.jetHorizonTransfer_of_dictionary","kind":"def","line":82,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Information/JetHorizonScaffold.lean#L82-L95","doc":"**A jet-horizon transfer is realisable from a complexity dictionary\n(sorry-free).**  Given the interpretive dictionary and the derived\nhorizon opacity `chi ≠ 0 ⇒ answerBlocked`, one obtains a\n`JetHorizonTransfer chi`.  This *reduces* the transfer to the\ndictionary — it does not prove the dictionary (which has no instance).\nIt shows the transfer's open content is exactly the degree↔complexity\nidentification, nothing more. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Information.ComplexityDictionary.witnesses_leak","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Information.ComplexityDictionary.witnesses_leak","kind":"theorem","line":80,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Information/JetHorizonScaffold.lean#L80-L80","doc":"Degree-≥1 witnesses are always available (they leak across 𝓗). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Information.ComplexityDictionary.separation_of_blocked","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Information.ComplexityDictionary.separation_of_blocked","kind":"theorem","line":78,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Information/JetHorizonScaffold.lean#L78-L78","doc":"**The conjectural transfer**: a blocked degree-0 answer with\nverifiable degree-≥1 witnesses is exactly the `P ≠ NP` separation\nin the QOU. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Information.ComplexityDictionary.witnessVerifiable","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Information.ComplexityDictionary.witnessVerifiable","kind":"def","line":74,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Information/JetHorizonScaffold.lean#L74-L74","doc":"Degree-≥1 certificates are poly-verifiable (the `NP` side). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Information.ComplexityDictionary.answerBlocked","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Information.ComplexityDictionary.answerBlocked","kind":"def","line":72,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Information/JetHorizonScaffold.lean#L72-L72","doc":"The decision answer (degree-0) is poly-time inaccessible when the\nobstruction blocks it. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Information.ComplexityDictionary.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Information.ComplexityDictionary.mk","kind":"ctor","line":69,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Information/JetHorizonScaffold.lean#L69-L69","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Information.ComplexityDictionary","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Information.ComplexityDictionary","kind":"class","line":62,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Information/JetHorizonScaffold.lean#L62-L80","doc":"**The degree↔complexity dictionary (the open bridge, §3b-cond).**\nThe interpretive identification the transfer rests on.  `NPVerify`\nand `PDecide` are opaque `Prop`s (no Mathlib complexity theory); the\nfields state the *chosen* reading — degree-≥1 certificates are\n`NP`-verifiable, the degree-0 answer being blocked obstructs `P` —\nand derive the QOU separation.  **No instance is declared**: this map\nis the irreducible conjectural input (anti-laundering). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Information.ObservationGrading.degree_split","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Information.ObservationGrading.degree_split","kind":"theorem","line":60,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Information/JetHorizonScaffold.lean#L60-L60","doc":"The observable splits by degree. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Information.ObservationGrading.witness","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Information.ObservationGrading.witness","kind":"def","line":58,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Information/JetHorizonScaffold.lean#L58-L58","doc":"Degree-≥1 component: the verifiable witness data that leaks. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Information.ObservationGrading.answer","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Information.ObservationGrading.answer","kind":"def","line":56,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Information/JetHorizonScaffold.lean#L56-L56","doc":"Degree-0 component of the observed value: the decision answer. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Information.ObservationGrading.τ","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Information.ObservationGrading.τ","kind":"def","line":54,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Information/JetHorizonScaffold.lean#L54-L54","doc":"The observation trace `τ : A → k` (Markov trace / observation frame). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Information.ObservationGrading.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Information.ObservationGrading.mk","kind":"ctor","line":52,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Information/JetHorizonScaffold.lean#L52-L52","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Information.ObservationGrading","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Information.ObservationGrading","kind":"structure","line":49,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Information/JetHorizonScaffold.lean#L49-L60","doc":"**The observation frame / trace grading.**  An observable result\n`τ(a)` splits into its degree-0 part (the decision **answer**) and its\ndegree-≥1 part (the **witness** / Hawking-leakage data). ","signatureChunk":0}]}